<h2>Why the gap exists at all</h2>
<p>The host sits in the studio, close to a good microphone. The guest sometimes joins from another room, on another microphone, or over a remote call. Editing evens out the episode as a whole, but it leaves the gap inside the conversation. <a href="{{ collections.byKey.how[lang] }}">Here's how the app deals with it</a>.</p>
